# Security headers Cloudflare Pages adds to every response. None of them change how
# the site looks or works: no sniffing file types, no full addresses sent to other
# sites, and no access to the camera, microphone, location, payments or USB.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
